        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Direct democracy</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">508 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Power held by</span><span class="info-stat-val">The citizens themselves, meeting in an assembly or voting in referendums and initiatives; councils and officials prepare and carry out their decisions</span></div>
